### 2. Login as Admin / Developer (Copy super_token from response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/super/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "developer@poshak.com",
  "password": "S@ty@m_11"
}

### 3. Create Shop Employee (Matches Column A in Google Sheets: e.g., "Sajan 2")
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/super/users
Authorization: Bearer {{superToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sajan",
  "mobile_number": "8709782651",
  "gender": "Male",
  "password": "S@j@n_123"
}

### 4. List All Shop Employees
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/super/users
Authorization: Bearer {{superToken}}

### 5. Trigger Immediate Google Sheets Attendance Sync
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/super/attendance/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{superToken}}

### 6. Block an Employee (Immediately revokes all their active phone sessions)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/super/users/{{targetUserId}}/block
Authorization: Bearer {{superToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Left the shop"
}

### 7. Unblock an Employee
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/super/users/{{targetUserId}}/unblock
Authorization: Bearer {{superToken}}

### 8. Developer Moderation (Lock username, purge bad docs, or override locked DOB)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/super/users/{{targetUserId}}/moderation
Authorization: Bearer {{superToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "force_username": "sajan_official",
  "can_edit_username": false,
  "purge_all_documents": false,
  "can_upload_documents": true,
  "override_dob": "2002-05-15"
}

### 9. Send Broadcast Notification to All Employees
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/super/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{superToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Diwali Shop Timing Update",
  "body": "Tomorrow the shop will open at 9:30 AM sharp."
}

### 10. Publish New APK Version (Triggers Force Update Modal on Android)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/super/releases
Authorization: Bearer {{superToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version_name": "1.1.0",
  "version_code": 2,
  "apk_download_url": "https://example.com/poshak-v1.1.0.apk",
  "release_notes": "Improved attendance calendar speed and added certificate vault.",
  "is_force_update": true
}
